      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just being disoriented. it feels like the story is just... over. like i've already reached the credits and now i'm just stuck in the post-credits scene where nothing happens. there's no point in trying to rebuild or \"find a new passion\" because that person is gone for good. the athlete is dead. i'm just the leftovers. i feel like i'm just taking up space that doesn't belong to me anymore.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
