      "content": "it's just hard to see why i should keep pretending. everyone keeps telling me \"it gets better\" or \"you'll find something else,\" but they don't get it. they didn't live for that. they didn't have their whole identity tied to being the best. to me, it feels like the most dignified thing would be to just... accept that the performance is over. why force a sequel when the main character already left the stage?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
